<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S4.SS3" title="In 4 Experiment ‣ Veri-R1: Toward Precise and Faithful Claim Verification via Online Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4.3 </span>Baseline</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S4.SS4" title="In 4 Experiment ‣ Veri-R1: Toward Precise and Faithful Claim Verification via Online Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4.4 </span>Result</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SSx4.SSS0.Px1" title="In Main Result ‣ 4 Experiment ‣ Veri-R1: Toward Precise and Faithful Claim Verification via Online Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Online claim verification remains a challenging task for current models.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SSx4.SSS0.Px2" title="In Main Result ‣ 4 Experiment ‣ Veri-R1: Toward Precise and Faithful Claim Verification via Online Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Online RL training substantially enhances models’ verification capabilities.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SSx4.SSS0.Px3" title="In Main Result ‣ 4 Experiment ‣ Veri-R1: Toward Precise and Faithful Claim Verification via Online Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">RL training outperforms SFT in the claim verification domain.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SSx5.SSS0.Px1" title="In Other Findings ‣ 4 Experiment ‣ Veri-R1: Toward Precise and Faithful Claim Verification via Online Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Supervised Fine-Tuning does not guarantee improvement</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SSx5.SSS0.Px2" title="In Other Findings ‣ 4 Experiment ‣ Veri-R1: Toward Precise and Faithful Claim Verification via Online Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Model size advantage is task-dependent</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SSx5.SSS0.Px3" title="In Other Findings ‣ 4 Experiment ‣ Veri-R1: Toward Precise and Faithful Claim Verification via Online Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">REFUTE is generally the hardest label for models</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S5" title="In Veri-R1: Toward Precise and Faithful Claim Verification via Online Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5 </span>Analysis</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_section">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S5.SS1" title="In 5 Analysis ‣ Veri-R1: Toward Precise and Faithful Claim Verification via Online Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.1 </span>Effect of Evidence Reward</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S5.SS2" title="In 5 Analysis ‣ Veri-R1: Toward Precise and Faithful Claim Verification via Online Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.2 </span>Effect of Weight Validity</span></a></li>
